# Customer data. Resources/ is the Tally sundry-debtors export — 225 real
# ledgers with addresses and GSTINs — and Supporting Documents/ holds real
# customer quotations. Neither is loaded by the application or the tests
# (the .xlsx is only the default path for `npm run import:customers`), so
# neither needs to be in a repository every developer clones. They are handed
# over separately. The reference .docx files at the repository root are a
# different case and stay tracked: docx.test.ts and parser.test.ts read them.
Resources/
Supporting Documents/
